<title>FINLAND: UNIBANK OPENS HELSINKI BRANCH.</title>
<headline>UNIBANK OPENS HELSINKI BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish bank Unibank said on Thursday it would officially inaugurate its Helsinki branch office on Friday, June 13, after half a year in operation.</p>
<p>&quot;The opening of the Helsinki branch office is an extension of the implmentation of Unibank's Nordic strategy which began in summer 1996 by acquiring Aros Securities and establishing a banch in Stockholm,&quot; Unibank said in a statement.</p>
<p>An Oslo branch will be opened this autumn, it said.</p>
<p>The Helsinki branch has a staff of 12. It offers services to large and medium-sized Finnish firms engaged in international operations, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
